      "_comment": "personality is allowed only for the values a normal runtime sets. 0xffffffff is a query; 0 is Linux-native. ADDR_NO_RANDOMIZE (0x0040000) is deliberately absent, so a program cannot disable ASLR to make an exploit inside the sandbox more reliable.",
